  "instructions": [
    "Pound the garlic with salt, then mix it with lemon, curry powder, chili, oil, and pepper.",
    "Coat the chicken thighs in the aromatic marinade while the grill heats.",
    "Arrange the rosemary, thyme, and bay over the grill and place the chicken above the herbs.",
    "Cook with the lid closed when possible, turning as needed, until lightly charred and 165°F inside."
